          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "22.5pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "Alphabet is a collection of businesses — the largest of which is Google. We report Google in two segments, Google Services and Google Cloud; we also report all non-Google businesses collectively as Other Bets. For further details on our segments, see Part I, Item 1 Business and Note 15 of the Notes to Consolidated Financial Statements included in Item 8 of this Annual Report on Form 10-K.",
        "text_hash": "57dcde7c474e3cd951df95a19dc02362c414455cd14b1e9678c60c3eaf84cd60",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000449-d5dc915f",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[471]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 449,
        "reported_page": 30,
        "source_anchor": "iceb58926ff9849d5be7614e3b0f8e836_76",
        "style_signature": {
