          "font-weight": "700",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "text-align": "justify"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "Trends in Our Business and Financial Effect",
        "text_hash": "d5dc915fb8146e592fef5b96af6589e6aaccf9bb37c6b15ca362634ac23a79eb",
        "type": "heading_candidate"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000450-e6220e52",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[472]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 450,
        "reported_page": 30,
        "source_anchor": "iceb58926ff9849d5be7614e3b0f8e836_76",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-weight": "400",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "22.5pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "The following long-term trends have contributed to the results of our consolidated operations, and we anticipate that they will continue to affect our future results:",
        "text_hash": "e6220e52e0a1268974c288424b556b1da26476be6549dc8b7184cb9c23a2e392",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000451-07ed699c",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[473]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 451,
        "reported_page": 30,
        "source_anchor": "iceb58926ff9849d5be7614e3b0f8e836_76",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-weight": "700",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "padding-left": "10pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "22.5pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "•Users' behaviors and advertising continue to shift online as the digital economy evolves.",
        "text_hash": "07ed699c0b51093c893cdc4b0fad8fce2f8d2d8b1093fed823fa49a71f8ad633",
        "type": "list_item"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000452-5008754c",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[474]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 452,
        "reported_page": 30,
        "source_anchor": "iceb58926ff9849d5be7614e3b0f8e836_76",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-weight": "400",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "22.5pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "The continuing evolution of the online world has contributed to the growth of our business and our revenues since inception. We expect that this evolution will continue to benefit our business and our revenues, although at a slower pace than we have experienced historically. In addition, we face increasing competition for user engagement and advertisers, including from other developers and providers of AI products and services, which may affect our revenues.",
        "text_hash": "5008754cd7454a79e76b178aedc35eaf39785445e4d8d9fc913899a553003094",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000453-cc2d3afc",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[475]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 453,
        "reported_page": 30,
        "source_anchor": "iceb58926ff9849d5be7614e3b0f8e836_76",
        "style_signature": {
          "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
          "font-size": "10pt",
          "font-weight": "700",
          "line-height": "120%",
          "margin-top": "6pt",
          "padding-left": "10pt",
          "text-align": "justify",
          "text-indent": "22.5pt"
        },
        "table": null,
        "text": "•Users continue to access our products and services using diverse devices and modalities, which allows for new advertising formats that may benefit our revenues but adversely affect our margins.",
        "text_hash": "cc2d3afc2b1c6d968f883cca952fc43cb24ffaed59580e495d346b437513d8bf",
        "type": "list_item"
      }
    ],
